1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Prediction markets trade one event at a time. Branch expresses a conditional path across them.

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Choose the cadence, risk cap, collateral, and expected outcome for each leg. Only leg one is bound now.

3
00:00:42,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Before signing, Branch verifies the exact market generation, status, expiry, order grid, and live liquidity.

4
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:16,000
This real BTC 15m DOWN order filled on DreamDEX and later finalized as the winning outcome.

5
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:28,000
The payout was redeemed on Somnia Shannon. The matching settlement unlocked leg two.

6
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Branch binds a different live Event Contract just in time. Future orders are never pre-signed.

7
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:55,000
The original allocation and probability cap remain visible, and leg two needs a fresh wallet signature.

8
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Leg two filled UP, but the market finalized DOWN. Branch correctly stopped the remaining path.

9
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Fill, settlement, redemption, and P&L evidence remain inspectable after the position closes.

10
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Branch turns DreamDEX settlement into a non-custodial conditional trading primitive. Trade the path, not one candle.
